---
import Digi from '../layouts/Digi.astro';
---
<Digi title="Products | DigiInn360" description="Explore pharmacy management software and tailored business tools from DigiInn360.">
  <section class="inner-hero">
    <p class="section-kicker">BUSINESS SOFTWARE</p>
    <h1>Products</h1>
    <p>Explore software for everyday operations, from managing stock and sales to routing staff approvals.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="detail-block paper" id="pharmacy-management">
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">RETAIL PHARMACY</p>
      <h2>Pharmacy management software</h2>
      <img class="product-image" src="/digiinn/pharmacy-management.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Bring stock, billing and sales reporting into one workflow. DigiInn360 can tailor the software to how your pharmacy receives stock, serves customers and reviews performance.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Stock counts, batch tracking and expiry alerts</li>
        <li>Sales and billing at the counter</li>
        <li>Low-stock visibility and inventory reporting</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="text-link dark-link" href="mailto:info@digiinn360.com?subject=Pharmacy%20management%20software%20enquiry">Discuss your requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="detail-block paper">
    <div><p class="section-kicker">WORKFORCE OPERATIONS</p><h2>Leave management</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Route employee requests through your approval structure and give staff a clear view of their request status. See how DigiInn360 implemented it in a web and mobile project.</p>
      <a class="text-link dark-link" href="/projects/leave-management-application/">View the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Digi>
